{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1301653-can-you-be-both-a-demon-blooded-fractal","id":1301653,"title":"Can you be both a Demon blooded fractal...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-01T09:17:39-07:00","id":1301653,"title":"Can you be both a Demon blooded fractal...","content":".... and a Psychic Vampire? Am I missing something that shoots such a combo down or is it cool to play?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-01T09:44:13-07:00","id":1301660,"title":"","content":"I mean, mechanically, nothing stops you. It all depends on the group you're playing with. Shine on, crazy bugger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T17:20:17-07:00","id":1302062,"title":"","content":"You could make a Wolf-Blooded ,Fae-touched ,Dhampire,Proiximi, <br /> <br /> Probably was engineered by the GM in a Contrived seeming manner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T18:21:10-07:00","id":1302071,"title":"","content":"Strictly speaking, the psychic vampire merits and the others ones in Hurt Locker are supposed to be isolated from other Templates, even minor ones (there is an implication that you can learn &quot;normal&quot; supernatural merits, as you can't have Thief of Fate and the slightly-cheaper Atariya equivalent, suggesting you were meant to be able to buy it otherwise).<br /> <br /> Loosely speaking, it is your game, and they are effectively psychic merits that you could otherwise take. Psychic vampirism doesn't take a specific form or even have a specific origin - in fact, none of them spell out the origins of the situations. You could potentially develop the ability. Also, the write-up explicitly mentions that it could come from a relic, so you could acquire it that way.<br /> <br /> I've actually tried to figure out what could happen if you had as many minor templates and merit templates as possible. I discovered the one impossibility logically (using human biology, at least) was being a Dhampir and a Fractal, by virtue that you can't be the child of one vampire and two demons simultaneously. Ironically, you could potentially be more powerful by being a dhampir and a Nephilim from the Demon Storyteller's Guide anyways... (also, the whole mix is a weird mix of overpowered nonsense and perpetual suffering... at least until you cut the Infected loose).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T18:29:46-07:00","id":1302072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EndlessKng</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1301653-can-you-be-both-a-demon-blooded-fractal?p=1302071#post1302071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strictly speaking, the psychic vampire merits and the others ones in Hurt Locker are supposed to be isolated from other Templates, even minor ones (there is an implication that you can learn &amp;quot;normal&amp;quot; supernatural merits, as you can't have Thief of Fate and the slightly-cheaper Atariya equivalent, suggesting you were meant to be able to buy it otherwise).<br /> <br /> Loosely speaking, it is your game, and they are effectively psychic merits that you could otherwise take. Psychic vampirism doesn't take a specific form or even have a specific origin - in fact, none of them spell out the origins of the situations. You could potentially develop the ability. Also, the write-up explicitly mentions that it could come from a relic, so you could acquire it that way.<br /> <br /> I've actually tried to figure out what could happen if you had as many minor templates and merit templates as possible. I discovered the one impossibility logically (using human biology, at least) was being a Dhampir and a Fractal, by virtue that you can't be the child of one vampire and two demons simultaneously. Ironically, you could potentially be more powerful by being a dhampir and a Nephilim from the Demon Storyteller's Guide anyways... (also, the whole mix is a weird mix of overpowered nonsense and perpetual suffering... at least until you cut the Infected loose).</div> </div> </div> </div>Well what if your a Dhampire and both your Mom and Dad Both make deals with Demons, selling there parentage?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T18:36:27-07:00","id":1302075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1301653-can-you-be-both-a-demon-blooded-fractal?p=1302072#post1302072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well what if your a Dhampire and both your Mom and Dad Both make deals with Demons, selling there parentage?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ehhh... that wouldn't fly in my book since either you're only selling the role of parent and not the genetic component or you are selling the whole child and to become a fractal they replace the Dhampir blood.<br /> <br /> I think the way you COULD do it is for two demons to atend one of the Dhampir-creation rites under Deep Cover and receive the blessings that grant fertility and create a dhampir. That would be the only way I could conceive of off hand","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T05:35:19-07:00","id":1302175,"title":"","content":"&quot;Demon genetics&quot; are quite screwy and selling the role of one parent to a demon does convert them into a demon blooded.<br /> <br /> Also, demon blooded can have supernatural merits + there is no prerequisite of &quot;cannot be a *blooded or whatever&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T12:50:35-07:00","id":1302304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1301653-can-you-be-both-a-demon-blooded-fractal?p=1302175#post1302175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Demon genetics&amp;quot; are quite screwy and selling the role of one parent to a demon does convert them